@PhilHealthProxy_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### Get member information by PhilHealth Identification Number
GET {{PhilHealthProxy_HostAddress}}/api/members/12-345678901-2
Accept: application/json

###

### Verify a member
POST {{PhilHealthProxy_HostAddress}}/api/members/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "philHealthNumber": "12-345678901-2",
  "lastName": "Dela Cruz",
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15"
}

###

### Check Konsulta eligibility
POST {{PhilHealthProxy_HostAddress}}/api/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "philHealthNumber": "12-345678901-2",
  "facilityAccreditationNumber": "ZFF00000000001",
  "consultationDate": "2026-04-27",
  "diagnosisCodes": ["J00", "A09"]
}

###

